'''Shen Rubedo''' is an [[NPC]] in the {{Zone|Cerebral Citadel}} in the [[Rift Dimension]].

== Purpose ==
'''Shen Rubedo''' informs the player that every Shen across every dimension is being assembled to become the ultimate lifeform and achieve unparalleled greatness.

